  "e": {
    "_what": "The capital E cut through the door, asked for as a calligraphy E on 2026-10-07 (who asked is in DECISIONS.md, not in the room, which names nobody). It is the outline of Great Vibes' capital, taken from the face's own file in github.com/google/fonts (ofl/greatvibes/GreatVibes-Regular.ttf) on 2026-10-07 with fontTools, its curves kept as they are, in the font's own units with y going up. It is drawn, not set: no font is loaded for it, so the Foundry has nothing to list. The face's designer and licence are read off its METADATA.pb and OFL.txt, and the door's credit prints them.",
